# What never enters the build context.
#
# .env first and loudest: an image is pushed to a registry, and a secret baked
# into a layer is readable by anyone who can pull it, forever, even after the
# file is deleted in a later layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

node_modules
dist
build
coverage
*.log

# Tests, docs and tooling are not part of the running product.
tests
docs
postman
ops
# …except the grants script, which every migration run applies.
!ops/roles.sql
vitest.config.ts
docker-compose.yml
README.md
.git
